1
00:00:00,439 --> 00:02:02,730
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,039 --> 00:02:08,030
No living being was harmed during
the filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:11,260
Episode 118

4
00:02:11,990 --> 00:02:14,040
It's good that we took...

5
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:16,250
Nayman's courage from him.

6
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:19,880
And the people saw the defeat of those
who are said to be invincible.

7
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:23,940
They are the ones
who will move now.

8
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:26,220
What will their next campaign be?

9
00:02:26,610 --> 00:02:29,720
Soldiers are spread around the
districts of Candar and Karesi.

10
00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:31,850
It is clear that they are after revenge.

11
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:35,640
They will want to strike back
with a bloody attack, Osman Bey.

12
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:38,250
If that was his goal...

13
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:42,240
he'd have wanted then to destroy everyone
with the armies of the Beys here.

14
00:02:43,190 --> 00:02:45,060
He wants us...

15
00:02:46,210 --> 00:02:47,500
who don't obey...

16
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,060
and who rebel.

17
00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:56,120
We have basically
destroyed the Nayman's army.

18
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,570
His strength was no longer
what it was before on this earth.

19
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:02,110
He'll want his strength back.

20
00:03:03,050 --> 00:03:05,590
He'll want to attack us with Olof.

21
00:03:05,890 --> 00:03:10,100
But he will not move until
he is sure that he will win.

22
00:03:11,050 --> 00:03:12,820
He attacked Olof several times.

23
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:15,100
He has become weak militarily.

24
00:03:15,130 --> 00:03:17,830
With what force will they
unite and move against us?

25
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:22,020
Olof is the successor of Kantakuzenos.

26
00:03:22,710 --> 00:03:26,410
The emperor believed that he would
protect the inheritance of Aya Nikola.

27
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:29,310
The emperor must
have sent an army to him.

28
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:34,760
So getting İnegöl back just got harder.

29
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:37,310
It's just the right time
to take inegöl back.

30
00:03:38,290 --> 00:03:39,900
We'll take it one way or another.

31
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:42,990
There is no other solution.

32
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,810
Otherwise, Nayman will unite
with Olof's army.

33
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:47,870
Okay, but how will that be done, my Bey?

34
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:56,190
İnegöl Castle

35
00:04:14,990 --> 00:04:17,339
Osman took you from me.

36
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:24,240
My younger brother.

37
00:04:31,630 --> 00:04:33,050
Don't worry, Dan.

38
00:04:33,290 --> 00:04:36,110
I will capture
all his children.

39
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,920
And I will fill my mug with their blood.

40
00:04:43,730 --> 00:04:46,040
I will make them live in hell.

41
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:54,360
We will organize a funeral
worthy of knights.

42
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:57,410
Tell those in the church...

43
00:04:57,660 --> 00:04:59,610
for them to prepare.

44
00:05:00,110 --> 00:05:01,350
Olof.

45
00:05:02,090 --> 00:05:04,590
Dan never believed in your religion.

46
00:05:05,570 --> 00:05:08,390
He pretended this just for you.

47
00:05:09,810 --> 00:05:11,080
Let him go to Valhalla.

48
00:05:11,110 --> 00:05:12,550
How did you know?

49
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:23,440
Jesus will embrace Dan.

50
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:26,930
We will avenge him.

51
00:05:28,610 --> 00:05:31,900
Neither Odin nor Jesus.

52
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:39,110
I believe in revenge now.

53
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:46,190
We will be together so that we can take revenge.

54
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:50,970
What shall we do? Say it.

55
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:57,460
Osman did not burn
our souls only.

56
00:05:59,010 --> 00:06:03,100
We will take our revenge with those
who are angry with him.

57
00:06:03,590 --> 00:06:04,580
Who are they?

58
00:06:09,540 --> 00:06:11,170
Commander Nayman is coming.

59
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:37,840
Olof.

60
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:45,500
Nayman must have reached İnegöl by now.

61
00:06:46,090 --> 00:06:48,320
But he isn't the only one who
gets inside.

62
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:52,820
Cerkutay and Ülgen have
been in it for a while now.

63
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:57,700
That is why we pounce on Olof
on all his campaigns, Öktem Bey.

64
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,650
Thanks to them both.

65
00:07:00,730 --> 00:07:02,930
Turgut knows the castle best.

66
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:05,660
Turgut, take some warriors with you.

67
00:07:05,890 --> 00:07:07,060
Don't worry.

68
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,500
Cerkutay will help you get inside.

69
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:11,120
I will do as you said.

70
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:33,130
It's time, Ülgen.

71
00:07:35,730 --> 00:07:37,900
We will make İnegöl our home again.

72
00:07:38,370 --> 00:07:40,500
We will return to Yenişehir.

73
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:44,040
Truly? Is this correct?

74
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:45,530
Will our job end?

75
00:07:45,530 --> 00:07:47,540
It will be over, Ülgen, it
will be over.

76
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:50,340
Osman Bey lit the fire of conquest.

77
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:52,670
And he informed us of our mission.

78
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:57,320
We will open the gates of İnegöl.

79
00:07:57,820 --> 00:08:01,000
Thank Allah, the longing will end.

80
00:08:01,210 --> 00:08:02,620
Thank Allah.

81
00:08:03,730 --> 00:08:05,490
Listen to me carefully now.

82
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:09,030
We'll get Turgut Bey and
his warriors inside first...

83
00:08:09,030 --> 00:08:10,080
secretly.

84
00:08:14,710 --> 00:08:16,190
Thank you, Osman Bey.

85
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:21,450
But taking İnegöl will only stop Nayman.

86
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:26,030
What are we going to do to eliminate
Nayman? Tell us about this.

87
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,780
Everyone will work.

88
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,990
The campaign (move)
that will stop Nayman...

89
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,150
I will keep it a secret.

90
00:08:38,419 --> 00:08:39,919
What is our campaign now?

91
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:43,409
We will unite with Mother Sultan.

92
00:08:47,300 --> 00:08:50,020
How will we convince
Mother Sultan, Osman Bey?

93
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:52,260
While Beys want to solve their
affairs with gold coins...

94
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:55,310
Sultan Mother wanted to gather armies.

95
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:57,740
When I cut off Samagar's head...

96
00:08:58,380 --> 00:09:00,590
It was Mother Sultan who stood behind me.

97
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:03,530
Even if what you say is a
reason to convince her...

98
00:09:03,710 --> 00:09:06,380
İsmihan can never be trusted.

99
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:09,490
We don't have to trust Mother Sultan.

100
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:11,410
But if she's on our side...

101
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,950
Then Nayman's job
will become harder.

102
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:18,120
Because
Mother Sultan is now on Nayman's side.

103
00:09:18,570 --> 00:09:20,260
If we take her to our side...

104
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:23,110
Then we will be stronger.

105
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:29,930
If our matter remains for Mother Sultan,
then be careful not to lose our heads early.

106
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:34,430
We call this a prayer, Öktem Bey.

107
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:37,160
You are right, Turgut Bey,
you are right.

108
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,010
Osman Bey.

109
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:42,850
I will start preparations for the infiltration
to İnegöl with my warriors.

110
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:46,080
May our conquest be blessed.

111
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:53,950
- Boran.
- My Bey.

112
00:09:56,610 --> 00:09:59,850
Send Alps to the sites
of Çamönü and Kızılağaç.

113
00:09:59,890 --> 00:10:01,490
You will lead them.

114
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:02,720
Increase the measures.

115
00:10:03,210 --> 00:10:05,440
They will attack us from all directions.

116
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,540
Your command, my Bey.

117
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,110
Let's go.

118
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,400
When will your army come?

119
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,580
My army will be here in a few days.

120
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:37,120
And when my army comes, I will
destroy Osman's tribe and his city.

121
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:45,840
Osman knows that we will attack him.

122
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:47,990
He posted guards around his tribe.

123
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:51,430
He set traps around it.

124
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:55,820
- He did the same in Yenişehir.
- We have a large number.

125
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:59,030
What trap can stop us?

126
00:11:00,460 --> 00:11:03,310
Do you know the tale of the deer, Olof?

127
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:09,330
Five hungry wolves...

128
00:11:09,890 --> 00:11:12,920
they smelled deer.

129
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,400
And they went after it.

130
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:20,890
Don't go, said the old wolf.

131
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:24,340
But the young wolves went.

132
00:11:25,110 --> 00:11:27,080
When it was morning...

133
00:11:27,810 --> 00:11:30,220
All the wolves were dead.

134
00:11:31,130 --> 00:11:34,610
And the deer was looking at the old wolf.

135
00:11:36,580 --> 00:11:38,200
How did this happen?

136
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:40,050
Let us know.

137
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:44,470
The mountain was not for wolves.

138
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:47,370
It was for deer.

139
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:50,440
It knows the abyss.

140
00:11:50,790 --> 00:11:53,340
It knows the straits in it.

141
00:11:53,790 --> 00:11:58,470
When the tribe that
Osman traps is destroyed...

142
00:11:58,970 --> 00:12:02,620
You won't have anything left.

143
00:12:03,590 --> 00:12:05,190
There is no need.

144
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:07,400
Commander Nayman.

145
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:10,990
What do you suggest?

146
00:12:18,430 --> 00:12:21,750
Women speak little
when in captivity.

147
00:12:21,750 --> 00:12:25,630
But she doesn't shut up when she's free,
does she, Olof?

148
00:12:27,170 --> 00:12:29,760
I'm Frigg.

149
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,610
I know Yenişehir very well.

150
00:12:32,590 --> 00:12:35,220
I took the goods
to deceive them.

151
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,980
You will tell me, woman.

152
00:12:44,870 --> 00:12:47,180
You were with them for a long time.

153
00:12:48,470 --> 00:12:51,500
What do we need for
the blockade of Yenişehir?

154
00:12:53,750 --> 00:12:57,100
Show us the sites around Yenişehir.

155
00:12:57,630 --> 00:13:00,770
How many people protect
its exits and entrances?

156
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,400
At Çamönü...

157
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:14,300
There are old warriors who
call themselves Ghazi.

158
00:13:14,620 --> 00:13:17,360
They are skilled warriors,
attacking them is difficult.

159
00:13:17,890 --> 00:13:21,930
But when we eliminate them,
we will have a great advantage.

160
00:13:22,290 --> 00:13:26,110
Woman, if you are
going to say such things...

161
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:28,450
you can always speak.

162
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:34,110
You will destroy this village, Olof.

163
00:13:34,940 --> 00:13:38,690
You will turn Ghazis into martyrs.

164
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,930
They won't live until tomorrow.

165
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:45,210
First, we will besiege Yenişehir.

166
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:50,260
Place your soldiers at
the exits of the tribe...

167
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:51,400
Olof.

168
00:13:51,770 --> 00:13:54,900
Whoever exits, do not
allow him to enter again.

169
00:13:55,380 --> 00:14:00,010
Whoever comes out of the tribe will
go under the dirt, Commander Nayman.

170
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:04,450
Destroy and destroy and erase!

171
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:11,000
Make the bravest fear, Olof.

172
00:14:14,110 --> 00:14:16,740
What will you do in this
situation, Commander?

173
00:14:17,060 --> 00:14:22,800
I'll take their most valuable possession.

174
00:14:23,610 --> 00:14:27,860
I will strike Osman from a
place he never expects.

175
00:14:28,420 --> 00:14:30,830
Come on, let's get started.

176
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:41,010
Yenişehir

177
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:56,490
Since you two summoned me in such a hurry,
you must have determined my punishment, right?

178
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:01,940
We thought a lot.

179
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:04,760
And we found a suitable punishment for you,
Bengi Hatun.

180
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,960
You are going to İnegöl.

181
00:15:11,130 --> 00:15:12,130
Why?

182
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:14,680
You made Esma work as a spy for you.

183
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:15,970
Yes.

184
00:15:16,780 --> 00:15:19,760
Now you're going to work as a spy for us,
Bengi Hatun.

185
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:21,860
You'll bring Frigg to us.

186
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:26,240
Do you hear what you're saying, Hatuns?

187
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:28,080
How will that happen?

188
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:31,220
Frigg won't trust me anymore.

189
00:15:31,390 --> 00:15:34,450
You'll think about it
from now on, Bengi Hatun.

190
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:37,760
Osman Bey
will take İnegöl, Bengi Hatun.

191
00:15:38,530 --> 00:15:40,780
Don't you want revenge on Olof?

192
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:49,140
We'll get Frigg and her soldiers out of
the palace first and reduce their number.

193
00:15:50,810 --> 00:15:52,700
Now, say it, Bengi Hatun.

194
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:54,210
Are you with us?

195
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:30,650
Söğüt

196
00:16:40,250 --> 00:16:42,040
What's the situation, Bayındır?

197
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,820
Not enough, Mother Sultan.

198
00:16:45,370 --> 00:16:47,740
Our losses are many.

199
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:51,900
I don't want to say it...

200
00:16:52,850 --> 00:16:55,750
but we had to listen to Osman.

201
00:16:56,290 --> 00:17:00,109
Choosing war, not reconciliation.

202
00:17:03,079 --> 00:17:05,598
Surrendering to someone like Nayman...

203
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:09,250
I find this very humiliating.

204
00:17:11,670 --> 00:17:12,910
Anyway.

205
00:17:13,848 --> 00:17:16,089
Put these with the rest.

206
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:30,480
Mother Sultan.

207
00:17:30,510 --> 00:17:33,380
Osman Bey came and asked to see you.

208
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:37,580
Osman Bey is a good man.

209
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:42,480
We mentioned his name, and he came.

210
00:17:44,010 --> 00:17:45,210
Let him in.

211
00:18:08,930 --> 00:18:14,000
What's the point of coming to me
after you burned Nayman's headquarters?

212
00:18:14,630 --> 00:18:18,460
Do you want to drag me
into the fire that will burn you?

213
00:18:18,970 --> 00:18:21,850
You say exactly what is on my mind,
Mother Sultan.

214
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:26,900
Do you know what Nayman thinks?

215
00:18:29,340 --> 00:18:35,750
He wants your head because of your
rebellion and because you killed Samagar.

216
00:18:36,710 --> 00:18:39,220
and he wants to
take the gold coins, of course.

217
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:44,990
Why did Samagar die?

218
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:54,350
İnegöl Castle

219
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:06,650
Bengi.

220
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:09,760
So you came to your death with your feet,
right?

221
00:19:11,410 --> 00:19:13,020
You pulled me into a trap.

222
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:16,540
Don't be stupid, Frigg.

223
00:19:18,850 --> 00:19:21,900
Would you have made us bait for Nayman
in the caravansary?

224
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:24,790
I don't know about the caravansary.

225
00:19:26,770 --> 00:19:28,490
I saved you.

226
00:19:28,890 --> 00:19:32,300
If I'm going to drag you into a trap,
what am I doing here?

227
00:19:32,370 --> 00:19:35,630
I brought you out
unharmed from that tribe.

228
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:39,900
If I wanted to, I would kill you there.

229
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,290
Why did you come?

230
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:49,970
You owe me your soul.

231
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:52,840
I want a price for that.

232
00:19:56,410 --> 00:19:57,680
Look, look.

233
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:00,440
What do you want? Tell me.

234
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:06,940
Something that works for both of us.

235
00:20:10,570 --> 00:20:13,680
I want to kill
Osman's sons.

236
00:20:19,220 --> 00:20:20,530
Why?

237
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:26,450
Why do you want this?

238
00:20:28,090 --> 00:20:30,830
Or are you going to trap me in a new trap?

239
00:20:35,620 --> 00:20:38,820
Why do you think I let
my daughter marry Aktemur?

240
00:20:40,020 --> 00:20:45,870
In order for Aktemur to become a Bey,
Orhan and Aladdin must die first.

241
00:20:46,930 --> 00:20:50,610
But if I do this myself,
my plan will be exposed.

242
00:20:51,850 --> 00:20:57,400
Now, you can do this
for revenge.

243
00:21:00,010 --> 00:21:02,720
There is revenge I want
to take from Osman.

244
00:21:06,540 --> 00:21:10,340
But you'll help me with this, Bengi.

245
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:13,530
Hear me well now.

246
00:21:15,780 --> 00:21:18,140
It all started with the matter
of the throne.

247
00:21:18,830 --> 00:21:23,520
Nayman wants your son Aladdin's throne.

248
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:30,550
Dazan Khan's conversion to Islam
will anger him.

249
00:21:32,260 --> 00:21:33,850
If we don't unite...

250
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:39,680
Konya and these border areas
will be easy preys for him.

251
00:21:44,500 --> 00:21:48,520
It was you who always spoiled the unit,
Osman Bey.

252
00:21:49,320 --> 00:21:52,330
I established the unit and
established the army.

253
00:21:52,780 --> 00:21:54,420
Well, what happened to the army?

254
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:58,870
You made a mistake, Mother Sultan.

255
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:03,220
You made us bow our
necks to the oppressor.

256
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:08,530
There will be no mistakes
anymore.

257
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:12,910
I will fight for the safety
of the border areas.

258
00:22:13,380 --> 00:22:15,820
And you will fight for
Konya's freedom.

259
00:22:17,620 --> 00:22:19,610
Are you offering to unite?

260
00:22:19,950 --> 00:22:22,160
The time for the offer
has passed.

261
00:22:23,810 --> 00:22:25,520
You will unite with me.

262
00:22:27,530 --> 00:22:29,050
What if I don't?

263
00:22:36,050 --> 00:22:38,330
I don't trust Bengi, my love.

264
00:22:38,850 --> 00:22:41,230
I can't sacrifice you
for Dan's revenge.

265
00:22:41,510 --> 00:22:43,510
That snake had its eye on the Beyhood.

266
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:45,950
She can't dare to deceive me.

267
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:47,650
But don't worry, my love.

268
00:22:47,710 --> 00:22:49,850
I will get my soldiers
into the city already.

269
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:52,060
And I will take the sons
of Osman from him.

270
00:22:52,150 --> 00:22:54,180
However, be careful, Frigg.

271
00:22:54,210 --> 00:22:56,760
Odin will bring death to the Turks today.

272
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:59,030
We will burn them and destroy them.

273
00:22:59,280 --> 00:23:01,150
We will kill them with pleasure.

274
00:23:02,430 --> 00:23:04,330
If we don't unite...

275
00:23:05,560 --> 00:23:07,570
Then they will burn us.

276
00:23:08,110 --> 00:23:10,060
They will.

277
00:23:10,230 --> 00:23:11,970
distract us.

278
00:23:13,320 --> 00:23:15,410
Olof with whom you collaborated...

279
00:23:16,530 --> 00:23:18,470
unites with Nayman.

280
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:22,610
The emperor will send an army for him.

281
00:23:23,550 --> 00:23:27,900
They will unite and will want to burn
the border areas first.

282
00:23:28,530 --> 00:23:33,360
And then, when they can't
get any support from Konya...

283
00:23:34,390 --> 00:23:36,700
They will attack your son Aladdin.

284
00:23:37,790 --> 00:23:39,940
How can you be so sure?

285
00:23:40,210 --> 00:23:41,910
I haven't been wrong yet.

286
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:46,500
As for you, I never saw
you made the right choice.

287
00:23:52,360 --> 00:23:53,910
Mother Sultan.

288
00:23:57,810 --> 00:23:59,910
Well, what if I'm right
again?

289
00:24:11,890 --> 00:24:13,700
What do you want from me?

290
00:24:15,620 --> 00:24:17,390
We'll take İnegöl.

291
00:24:18,290 --> 00:24:21,770
We will prevent the union of Nayman
with Olof's army.

292
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:24,950
But what I want from you is...

293
00:24:28,600 --> 00:24:30,950
to look like you're loyal to Nayman now.

294
00:24:32,950 --> 00:24:36,810
When we attack İnegöl,
I want you and your army to be with me.

295
00:24:39,760 --> 00:24:42,420
You say Olof will be a trouble for us.

296
00:24:43,940 --> 00:24:45,900
You say Konya is in danger...

297
00:24:46,660 --> 00:24:48,250
and border areas as well.

298
00:24:48,990 --> 00:24:52,250
Do you leave me
another choice, Osman Bey?

299
00:24:54,470 --> 00:24:55,740
No.

300
00:24:57,460 --> 00:24:59,020
No, Mother Sultan.

301
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:07,470
I will be waiting for you in Karayaz near
İnegöl at sunrise.

302
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:11,770
What if I come in there with the
Nayman army and destroy you?

303
00:25:15,550 --> 00:25:18,130
How do you trust me, Osman Bey?

304
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:24,790
There is nothing you can not do
for your son, Mother Sultan.

305
00:25:29,220 --> 00:25:34,290
You will stand behind
me for Sultan Aladdin.

306
00:25:35,610 --> 00:25:36,940
You have no other solution.

307
00:25:49,300 --> 00:25:51,240
I'm going to İnegöl tomorrow.

308
00:25:53,220 --> 00:25:55,500
Olof still listens my words.

309
00:25:56,650 --> 00:26:01,430
I'll try to take İnegöl with a game and
without bloodshed.

310
00:26:01,450 --> 00:26:02,670
Mother Sultan.

311
00:26:04,570 --> 00:26:07,930
Everything that has happened to us so far
has been due to games.

312
00:26:08,910 --> 00:26:10,510
Let hit go.

313
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:14,830
Leave it, if blood will be spilled.

314
00:26:16,290 --> 00:26:17,450
Let it shed.

315
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:23,460
When you come,
I'll be inside.

316
00:26:26,340 --> 00:26:32,230
If blood will be spilled,
I will spill the first drop.

317
00:26:38,420 --> 00:26:39,850
Take care.

318
00:26:41,130 --> 00:26:43,830
Take care, Osman Bey..

319
00:27:04,340 --> 00:27:08,320
Çamönü site (district)

320
00:27:15,630 --> 00:27:17,170
Attack!

321
00:27:18,370 --> 00:27:20,240
Leave no one alive!

322
00:28:28,830 --> 00:28:30,150
Where are you coming from?

323
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,640
From Kargın tribe.

324
00:28:31,790 --> 00:28:33,600
We brought Öktem Bey's goods.

325
00:28:33,910 --> 00:28:35,150
Search them.

326
00:28:47,320 --> 00:28:49,310
Bengi Hatun is waiting for us.

327
00:28:51,540 --> 00:28:52,630
Go.

328
00:29:21,560 --> 00:29:23,220
Open your eyes well.

329
00:29:23,730 --> 00:29:26,820
Osman's sons may be anywhere.

330
00:30:03,650 --> 00:30:04,380
Warriors!

331
00:30:04,960 --> 00:30:06,790
We should know if a bird flies by.

332
00:30:16,100 --> 00:30:18,680
Olof attacks Çamönü district.

333
00:30:18,820 --> 00:30:20,800
Come on, my brothers, come on!

334
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,470
Come, my daughter, come!

335
00:30:53,860 --> 00:30:55,280
Brothers, be alert!

336
00:30:58,100 --> 00:30:59,370
Allah is the greatest!

337
00:31:41,670 --> 00:31:44,090
My Bey, we have taken out the
women and children.

338
00:31:46,520 --> 00:31:47,400
Ghazis!

339
00:31:49,210 --> 00:31:51,560
Alps, step back, come on!

340
00:31:52,260 --> 00:31:53,000
Let's go!

341
00:32:14,540 --> 00:32:16,850
They think they have escaped from me.

342
00:32:18,250 --> 00:32:20,690
I will burn their lands.

343
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:24,220
I will behead them all.

344
00:32:30,330 --> 00:32:32,970
Get together, we'll go.

345
00:33:14,770 --> 00:33:15,950
Alps.

346
00:33:16,510 --> 00:33:17,740
Open your eyes well.

347
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:19,510
Take action, come on.

348
00:33:25,210 --> 00:33:26,340
Let's go.

349
00:34:03,280 --> 00:34:05,360
You two ugly little ones.

350
00:34:06,480 --> 00:34:07,750
Let's go.

351
00:34:28,940 --> 00:34:29,739
Trap!

352
00:34:31,340 --> 00:34:32,679
Where are you going, Frigg?

353
00:34:37,210 --> 00:34:40,100
Bengi, I'll make you pay for this.

354
00:34:40,889 --> 00:34:42,159
Game over, Frigg.

355
00:34:45,110 --> 00:34:47,230
You came for your death
with your own feet, Frigg.

356
00:34:47,340 --> 00:34:48,150
It's over now.

357
00:34:49,710 --> 00:34:50,580
You will die.

358
00:34:52,580 --> 00:34:55,850
Do you think I don't know
you ambushed me?

359
00:34:57,160 --> 00:34:57,980
Come here!

360
00:35:06,590 --> 00:35:09,470
We'll send you and
your foxes to hell today.

361
00:35:09,560 --> 00:35:10,610
Come on, Sisters.

362
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,010
Your end has come, Frigg.

363
00:36:02,120 --> 00:36:03,540
You can't kill me.

364
00:36:06,380 --> 00:36:07,980
I know everything about İsmihan.

365
00:36:08,830 --> 00:36:11,110
You fools need me.

366
00:36:11,520 --> 00:36:12,680
I will kill you all.

367
00:36:12,700 --> 00:36:13,440
Shut up!

368
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:35,620
You shouldn't have touched my children.

369
00:37:04,060 --> 00:37:04,780
Aktemur.

370
00:37:06,180 --> 00:37:08,200
Are all the Alps and Sisters
in their places?

371
00:37:08,220 --> 00:37:10,000
They're all alert, Malhun Hatun.

372
00:37:10,580 --> 00:37:11,910
Good.

373
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:27,770
What happened, Malhun?

374
00:37:28,490 --> 00:37:29,560
What happened?

375
00:37:30,200 --> 00:37:30,920
Osman.

376
00:37:31,260 --> 00:37:34,330
Olof destroyed Çamönü.

377
00:37:35,840 --> 00:37:36,910
What are you saying?

378
00:37:39,130 --> 00:37:40,340
He made a big raid.

379
00:37:41,850 --> 00:37:42,550
Dog!

380
00:37:43,740 --> 00:37:44,920
Dog!

381
00:37:49,160 --> 00:37:52,060
He would like to avenge
himself from the oppressed, then.

382
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:56,620
Fortunately, we had taken
measures.

383
00:37:57,270 --> 00:37:59,380
Boran and Konur are also
at that site. (district.)

384
00:37:59,490 --> 00:38:02,760
As he has done this to innocent people...

385
00:38:03,500 --> 00:38:06,840
I will charge him double for that.

386
00:38:07,460 --> 00:38:08,940
Everyone is on top of
their duties, My Bey.

387
00:38:09,020 --> 00:38:10,400
The female warriors (Sisters) struck first.

388
00:38:10,550 --> 00:38:14,530
The ladies had lured Frigg into an ambush.
They must've cut off her head by now.

389
00:38:14,860 --> 00:38:15,980
Inshallah.

390
00:38:17,770 --> 00:38:18,830
Inshallah.

391
00:38:26,570 --> 00:38:27,590
Alps!

392
00:38:45,990 --> 00:38:46,660
Sisters!

393
00:38:47,530 --> 00:38:48,640
You are fine, right?

394
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:49,680
Thank you, my Bey.

395
00:38:57,160 --> 00:38:59,820
Oh, my baby, oh my baby.

396
00:39:03,240 --> 00:39:05,530
Come on, come on.

397
00:39:08,720 --> 00:39:11,380
Aktemur, come on, take
the wounded to the infirmary.

398
00:39:11,940 --> 00:39:13,500
Your command, my Bey, come on.

399
00:39:15,690 --> 00:39:16,370
Let's go.

400
00:39:16,410 --> 00:39:16,940
Son.

401
00:39:24,320 --> 00:39:26,170
Son, you are fine, right?

402
00:39:26,490 --> 00:39:27,350
Thank you, my Bey.

403
00:39:36,530 --> 00:39:37,150
Warriors!

404
00:39:38,170 --> 00:39:41,350
Bandage your wounds and come to the court,
I am also going there.

405
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:43,060
Your command, my Bey.

406
00:39:50,690 --> 00:39:51,620
Bala.

407
00:39:56,330 --> 00:39:59,110
Here comes the Sisters who
cut the neck of the oppressor.

408
00:40:01,190 --> 00:40:04,140
We crushed the head of the snake
with our Sisters, my Bey.

409
00:40:05,180 --> 00:40:06,340
Mashallah.

410
00:40:07,460 --> 00:40:08,710
Thank Allah.

411
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:10,820
Come on, my lion, come on.

412
00:40:11,220 --> 00:40:12,200
- Come on.
- Come on.

413
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,490
Thank you.

414
00:40:18,070 --> 00:40:19,170
Thank you.

415
00:40:25,210 --> 00:40:26,790
İnegöl Castle

416
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:38,380
Nun Irene.

417
00:40:40,380 --> 00:40:41,500
Nun Irene.

418
00:40:49,310 --> 00:40:50,650
Nun Irene.

419
00:40:54,150 --> 00:40:55,110
Where are you?

420
00:40:56,770 --> 00:40:57,450
I am here!

421
00:40:57,680 --> 00:40:59,300
Stop!

422
00:41:02,420 --> 00:41:04,540
Where are you?
I looked for you everywhere!

423
00:41:05,660 --> 00:41:07,130
I am on top of my mission.

424
00:41:07,150 --> 00:41:08,410
I've been checking
the corridors.

425
00:41:08,500 --> 00:41:11,430
There are a lot of soldiers in the lower
corridor while the upper one is empty.

426
00:41:11,450 --> 00:41:12,500
Mashallah.

427
00:41:13,190 --> 00:41:16,110
You did this spy business well!

428
00:41:18,570 --> 00:41:19,970
You're my student.

429
00:41:21,360 --> 00:41:24,580
Yes, I am the daughter
of a black maid.

430
00:41:26,850 --> 00:41:28,120
Come on, we still
have a lot of work to do.

431
00:41:28,170 --> 00:41:30,550
Let's get to the corridor first.
We'll still get Turgut Bey inside.

432
00:41:34,220 --> 00:41:34,950
Let's go.

433
00:42:02,430 --> 00:42:03,570
I got those.

434
00:42:03,830 --> 00:42:05,260
You guard me from behind.

435
00:42:33,720 --> 00:42:35,120
My back, my back, my back!

436
00:42:40,610 --> 00:42:42,500
You smeared mud everywhere.

437
00:42:42,540 --> 00:42:43,460
Let's wipe.

438
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,180
What do you do?

439
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:48,760
Go clean somewhere else.

440
00:42:49,060 --> 00:42:51,100
I'm still going to wipe
out the entire castle.

441
00:42:51,330 --> 00:42:53,430
Do not prevent me from doing my job.

442
00:42:54,890 --> 00:42:56,400
Go away!

443
00:43:06,450 --> 00:43:09,150
I told you I would clean everywhere.

444
00:43:12,140 --> 00:43:14,720
Good job, Cerkutay!

445
00:43:16,350 --> 00:43:20,060
There are still a lot of places to
clean up and a lot of doors to open.

446
00:43:22,350 --> 00:43:23,410
Let's go.

447
00:43:23,780 --> 00:43:24,540
Yes.

448
00:43:39,020 --> 00:43:40,860
Can I come in, Mother Sultan?

449
00:43:42,010 --> 00:43:43,460
Come in, Celali.

450
00:43:50,890 --> 00:43:54,290
Soldiers are ready at
your command, Mother Sultan.

451
00:43:54,660 --> 00:43:57,040
They meet secretly in the woods.

452
00:43:57,680 --> 00:44:00,220
Are the soldiers who
will enter İnegöl with me ready?

453
00:44:00,300 --> 00:44:04,390
I've established a unit of guards skilled
in the use of swords, Mother Sultan.

454
00:44:07,280 --> 00:44:08,350
Good.

455
00:44:22,920 --> 00:44:24,810
Why are you still here, Celali?

456
00:44:30,700 --> 00:44:33,410
Say, say it, Celali.

457
00:44:36,880 --> 00:44:38,840
Standing with Osman...

458
00:44:39,820 --> 00:44:40,930
We know Nayman.

459
00:44:42,220 --> 00:44:44,200
Is it a correct decision, Mother Sultan?

460
00:44:45,330 --> 00:44:47,970
I don't stand on anyone's side, Celali.

461
00:44:48,930 --> 00:44:51,160
I'm just standing for myself.

462
00:44:53,240 --> 00:44:54,660
For this reason...

463
00:44:54,990 --> 00:44:58,420
If I think standing with Osman
is the right decision...

464
00:44:58,780 --> 00:45:01,560
it's the right decision.

465
00:45:03,700 --> 00:45:06,000
As you command, my Mother Sultan.

466
00:45:06,670 --> 00:45:12,050
If Nayman gives us a better offer...

467
00:45:13,700 --> 00:45:18,420
Then I'll consider that offer too, Celali.

468
00:45:39,270 --> 00:45:42,170
We fought bravely at
Çamönü, my Bey.

469
00:45:42,970 --> 00:45:45,870
And we came out with the
least losses we could get out of.

470
00:45:47,300 --> 00:45:48,300
However...

471
00:45:57,070 --> 00:46:03,090
we lost many Ghazis who fought near you...

472
00:46:03,995 --> 00:46:08,995
your father, and the invader Ertuğrul.

473
00:46:13,900 --> 00:46:16,350
Ghazis are our roots.

474
00:46:16,590 --> 00:46:19,640
They raised our Alps and
taught them what they know.

475
00:46:20,650 --> 00:46:24,580
Olof attacked our village, and
we beheaded Frigg.

476
00:46:24,680 --> 00:46:26,680
We avenged for our martyrs, my Bey.

477
00:46:27,220 --> 00:46:28,700
Thank Allah.

478
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:33,250
May Allah protect your hands that carry
swords and strike the necks of the oppressors.

479
00:46:33,420 --> 00:46:35,720
Allah bless you, my dear Bala.

480
00:46:36,350 --> 00:46:41,050
Frigg is the beginning of
the revenge we will take.

481
00:46:42,170 --> 00:46:48,400
In the war we will have with them, we
won't even allow them to have wounds.

482
00:46:50,200 --> 00:46:55,150
As they have killed our Ghazis on this land...

483
00:46:55,670 --> 00:46:59,570
we will also make their
blood flow on this earth.

484
00:47:01,870 --> 00:47:04,300
All preparations will be
completed tomorrow.

485
00:47:05,370 --> 00:47:08,200
The deadline we've given to
the oppressors has expired.

486
00:47:08,550 --> 00:47:10,870
We'll start moving tomorrow.

487
00:47:13,050 --> 00:47:19,820
And after we raise our
banner over İnegöl...

488
00:47:21,620 --> 00:47:24,120
we'll hold your wedding as promised.

489
00:47:25,290 --> 00:47:26,240
My Bey.

490
00:47:27,750 --> 00:47:30,080
Is the time right amidst
all these worries?

491
00:47:30,130 --> 00:47:32,130
Love does not wait.

492
00:47:32,650 --> 00:47:37,390
As war is a celebration, your wedding is
also a celebration, my son.

493
00:47:37,410 --> 00:47:39,410
Your command, my Bey.

494
00:47:45,800 --> 00:47:47,350
Can I come in, my Bey?

495
00:47:48,400 --> 00:47:49,650
Come in.

496
00:47:56,170 --> 00:47:59,130
My Bey, Öktem Bey and
Bengi Hatun are here.

497
00:47:59,200 --> 00:48:01,200
Ayşe Hatun welcomes them.

498
00:48:09,910 --> 00:48:11,510
Why don't you tell me...

499
00:48:11,680 --> 00:48:13,430
Sunguralp Bey?

500
00:48:16,700 --> 00:48:19,420
Welcome, my sheikh, welcome.

501
00:48:19,550 --> 00:48:20,900
Salam Alaikum.

502
00:48:20,970 --> 00:48:22,240
Alaikum Salam.

503
00:48:22,320 --> 00:48:24,070
Alaikum Salam, my sheikh.

504
00:49:06,570 --> 00:49:08,050
Why doesn't it open?

505
00:49:09,640 --> 00:49:11,540
It's stuck.

506
00:49:11,750 --> 00:49:13,750
But we will open it.

507
00:49:44,120 --> 00:49:45,920
There are voices
coming, my Bey.

508
00:49:51,450 --> 00:49:52,500
Cerkutay.

509
00:49:54,000 --> 00:49:55,670
Is that you, my brother?

510
00:49:57,650 --> 00:49:58,950
Turgut Bey.

511
00:49:59,350 --> 00:50:00,600
Turgut Bey.

512
00:50:01,520 --> 00:50:03,270
We've come, we'll open it.

513
00:50:03,340 --> 00:50:05,340
It's stuck, be patient a bit.

514
00:50:05,360 --> 00:50:07,360
We'll wait, brother.

515
00:50:07,900 --> 00:50:08,980
Thank you.

516
00:50:14,920 --> 00:50:18,220
Cerkutay, someone's coming, someone's coming!

517
00:50:18,320 --> 00:50:19,600
Back off!

518
00:50:21,290 --> 00:50:22,090
Traitors!

519
00:50:42,400 --> 00:50:45,920
- Turgut Bey.
- Mashallah.

520
00:50:52,740 --> 00:50:55,090
I hope you are well, brother.

521
00:50:57,700 --> 00:50:59,660
Thank Allah.

522
00:50:59,750 --> 00:51:01,300
I hope you are well, Ülgen Hatun.

523
00:51:01,510 --> 00:51:03,630
- Thank Allah I'm fine.
- Ülgen Hatun.

524
00:51:06,150 --> 00:51:08,360
We've come to our
new place, haven't we, brother?

525
00:51:08,460 --> 00:51:09,980
Praise be to Allah, my Bey.

526
00:51:10,120 --> 00:51:12,120
There is not much left to
raise our flag on, Inshallah.

527
00:51:12,820 --> 00:51:14,150
Inshallah.

528
00:51:14,220 --> 00:51:15,600
Let's go.

529
00:51:15,670 --> 00:51:17,670
Come on, Alps.

530
00:51:28,620 --> 00:51:32,150
My Sultan, I'm sorry, but...

531
00:51:32,200 --> 00:51:34,050
I don't get it.

532
00:51:34,190 --> 00:51:38,290
Whose side are we on?

533
00:51:38,850 --> 00:51:40,400
Osman's side?

534
00:51:40,600 --> 00:51:42,430
Or Nayman's side?

535
00:51:44,750 --> 00:51:47,240
I grab both ends of the rope...

536
00:51:47,350 --> 00:51:49,350
Bayındır.

537
00:51:49,950 --> 00:51:56,220
But now I'm doing whatever it
takes for our independence.

538
00:52:02,170 --> 00:52:04,620
Did you keep your promise?

539
00:52:06,200 --> 00:52:08,720
Mother Sultan?

540
00:52:29,300 --> 00:52:31,650
Is that all?

541
00:52:34,810 --> 00:52:38,760
Is this all the taxes you asked for?

542
00:52:43,300 --> 00:52:46,870
The rest is loaded on horses.

543
00:52:52,250 --> 00:52:56,950
Now it's your turn to
keep your word, Nayman.

544
00:52:58,150 --> 00:53:01,620
You will withdraw your Mongol soldiers
from Konya and from the tribes.

545
00:53:01,720 --> 00:53:05,290
I want to be sure that the
people will not be harmed.

546
00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:10,030
You will never be sure.

547
00:53:10,250 --> 00:53:13,150
The sword will not cut your necks...

548
00:53:13,170 --> 00:53:16,190
but they will always be on your neck.

549
00:53:17,170 --> 00:53:21,150
You will have difficulty in
sleeping and you will sweat.

550
00:53:22,350 --> 00:53:26,920
And you will remember your
disobedience, Mother Sultan.

551
00:53:29,500 --> 00:53:31,870
There is no disobedience, Nayman.

552
00:53:32,460 --> 00:53:34,610
My side is obvious.

553
00:53:37,270 --> 00:53:42,750
I will do everything to punish Osman
for the insolence he has done to you.

554
00:53:48,150 --> 00:53:52,120
I don't need you.

555
00:53:57,320 --> 00:54:01,150
My hands are enough
for all the insolent.

556
00:54:04,970 --> 00:54:06,170
Certainly.

557
00:54:07,130 --> 00:54:08,700
Absolutely.

558
00:54:10,720 --> 00:54:15,200
But allying with me won't
make you lose anything.

559
00:54:16,620 --> 00:54:19,370
Well, what do I gain from this alliance?

560
00:54:29,420 --> 00:54:32,650
Victory with minimal losses.

561
00:54:33,750 --> 00:54:36,320
They all listen to my words.

562
00:54:42,000 --> 00:54:44,370
What do you think about Osman?

563
00:54:45,770 --> 00:54:49,920
I am very curious about the
punishment you will give him.

564
00:54:52,370 --> 00:54:57,550
You will know it when
everyone knows it, Mother Sultan.

565
00:55:03,150 --> 00:55:12,450
Send the gold behind me
to the military headquarters...

566
00:55:12,950 --> 00:55:14,280
I want them all.

567
00:55:15,670 --> 00:55:17,350
Be our guest.

568
00:55:18,420 --> 00:55:21,000
Let us host you in the inn, Nayman.

569
00:55:22,670 --> 00:55:26,350
Send the gold after me, Mother Sultan...

570
00:55:28,170 --> 00:55:30,200
all of them.

571
00:55:38,950 --> 00:55:41,920
My Sultan.

572
00:55:43,520 --> 00:55:48,000
It would have been nice if he had
stayed, but he didn't stay and went.

573
00:55:48,570 --> 00:55:53,370
Obviously, he's going to
do a really bad job.

574
00:55:55,150 --> 00:55:59,600
He hides his campaign (move) as
if it were a secret.

575
00:56:01,400 --> 00:56:07,920
But he knows us well, Bayındır.

576
00:56:10,770 --> 00:56:15,650
He will not trust my fidelity to him
when it is about our independence.

577
00:56:16,290 --> 00:56:17,540
It's obvious.

578
00:56:31,920 --> 00:56:35,420
This is just the beginning, Osman.

579
00:56:35,420 --> 00:56:40,760
I will demolish your caravans, your
cities and your people...

580
00:56:41,280 --> 00:56:43,280
then, you!

581
00:56:46,570 --> 00:56:48,950
Frigg started with the people.

582
00:56:50,620 --> 00:56:51,870
Is there any news?

583
00:56:55,850 --> 00:56:58,370
It is clear that her work
has dragged on.

584
00:56:59,270 --> 00:57:01,820
Send soldiers to go and check the situation.

585
00:57:09,220 --> 00:57:11,550
Come, nun, come.

586
00:57:14,500 --> 00:57:18,200
You must be curious
as to why I called you.

587
00:57:23,620 --> 00:57:29,370
This is the spoils of our
revenge on the Turks.

588
00:57:33,500 --> 00:57:36,050
I want to dedicate these
for the great Jesus.

589
00:57:38,870 --> 00:57:40,670
I wanted to hear your opinion.

590
00:57:43,400 --> 00:57:46,780
Good, very good idea.

591
00:57:48,500 --> 00:57:52,600
In my opinion, be in
church at the crack of dawn.

592
00:57:52,940 --> 00:57:54,940
With those.

593
00:57:55,300 --> 00:57:57,710
And bring all your soldiers.

594
00:57:57,990 --> 00:57:58,990
All of them?

595
00:57:59,680 --> 00:58:00,680
Everyone?

596
00:58:03,120 --> 00:58:06,570
Not all of these people fit in the church.

597
00:58:09,620 --> 00:58:15,900
Then bring your most skilled
and best commanders and soldiers.

598
00:58:17,170 --> 00:58:20,500
Bring them to receive their
share of your prayers.

599
00:58:20,710 --> 00:58:22,340
And be blessed.

600
00:58:27,450 --> 00:58:29,250
This sounds good.

601
00:58:37,700 --> 00:58:41,420
The mother-in-law sent word that
she would come tomorrow morning.

602
00:58:48,470 --> 00:58:50,050
Nun.

603
00:58:51,000 --> 00:58:53,950
We'll have to postpone our holy
issue a bit.

604
00:58:55,620 --> 00:58:58,050
We'll have an important guest tomorrow.

605
00:59:03,020 --> 00:59:06,170
No problem, guests are more important.

606
00:59:07,150 --> 00:59:10,470
It is enough for you to come to church
after your guest is gone

607
00:59:11,950 --> 00:59:13,700
If you excuse me...

608
00:59:14,400 --> 00:59:16,100
I'll get some rest.

609
00:59:30,800 --> 00:59:32,270
Thank Allah.

610
00:59:33,220 --> 00:59:35,550
Tomorrow we have two weddings, my sheikh.

611
00:59:35,950 --> 00:59:37,550
Allah bless.

612
00:59:38,170 --> 00:59:39,550
Allah bless.

613
00:59:42,150 --> 00:59:45,300
You are completing half of your faith, son.

614
00:59:46,250 --> 00:59:51,270
Fear Allah for the other half.

615
00:59:52,820 --> 00:59:54,660
We ask for your prayers, my sheikh.

616
00:59:54,990 --> 00:59:56,530
May Allah bless you.

617
00:59:57,110 --> 00:59:58,210
Amen.

618
00:59:58,510 --> 01:00:04,730
May Allah bless your family, which you will establish,
and your faith.

619
01:00:07,030 --> 01:00:09,750
Congratulations, Oktem Bey.

620
01:00:10,630 --> 01:00:12,810
Thank you, my sheikh, thank you.

621
01:00:14,030 --> 01:00:18,150
Your heart is burning for your
daughter's separation on the one hand...

622
01:00:19,220 --> 01:00:22,150
On the other hand...

623
01:00:22,150 --> 01:00:26,920
Establishing such a great family must
please you the most...

624
01:00:26,920 --> 01:00:28,930
...isn't that true?

625
01:00:30,190 --> 01:00:32,550
Certainly, my sheikh.

626
01:00:35,050 --> 01:00:37,010
I have one daughter.

627
01:00:37,430 --> 01:00:42,710
My Lord did not give me a male child.

628
01:00:43,590 --> 01:00:45,130
There was Batur.

629
01:00:46,790 --> 01:00:49,490
I considered him more like a son
than a brother-in-law.

630
01:00:49,610 --> 01:00:50,630
He was martyred.

631
01:00:52,890 --> 01:00:57,830
But, now
I have another son.

632
01:01:00,370 --> 01:01:02,990
May my Lord bless their future, my sheikh.

633
01:01:03,750 --> 01:01:04,990
Amen

634
01:01:04,990 --> 01:01:06,990
Amen,
Inshallah.

635
01:01:06,990 --> 01:01:08,990
Amen

636
01:01:09,850 --> 01:01:14,230
For two young people to
establish a new family is crucial

637
01:01:17,530 --> 01:01:19,910
Our master, the Messenger of Allah...

638
01:01:20,850 --> 01:01:23,930
What did he say, dears?

639
01:01:24,930 --> 01:01:28,030
Marriage is my Sunnah

640
01:01:28,970 --> 01:01:32,690
Whoever does not act according to
my Sunnah is not on my side”

641
01:01:35,160 --> 01:01:44,470
“Marry, for I take a pride in your number
against the other communities."

642
01:01:46,750 --> 01:01:48,210
Sheikh grandfather.

643
01:01:50,610 --> 01:01:52,530
What is meant by number here?

644
01:01:54,390 --> 01:02:01,230
What is meant is the large number of believers
whom Allah has honored with the light of Islam

645
01:02:03,990 --> 01:02:07,650
These two
will marry and have children

646
01:02:07,650 --> 01:02:09,350
And those children...

647
01:02:09,510 --> 01:02:12,110
...will be raised with the morals of Islam

648
01:02:12,110 --> 01:02:19,510
And they will carry the banner of Islam
after their mother and father

649
01:02:24,350 --> 01:02:26,070
And when the Day of Judgment comes

650
01:02:26,590 --> 01:02:35,170
Everyone who defended this case will gather
around the Kawthar Basin next to the Messenger of Allah.

651
01:02:35,990 --> 01:02:38,570
Inshallah (if Allah permits), my sheikh.

652
01:02:39,190 --> 01:02:42,550
That is what is meant by the number.

653
01:02:46,490 --> 01:02:47,890
Aladdin.

654
01:02:50,770 --> 01:02:53,450
I see you are very excited
about this matter.

655
01:02:56,210 --> 01:02:57,610
But wait.

656
01:02:59,930 --> 01:03:05,030
Wait, because it's your
brother's turn first.

657
01:03:12,970 --> 01:03:14,930
I did not mean it, Osman Bey.

658
01:03:15,810 --> 01:03:18,030
Anyway, however you see fit.

659
01:03:21,950 --> 01:03:25,430
I know what the shahzade(prince) meant,
Osman Bey.

660
01:03:26,010 --> 01:03:31,150
He was asking about the other wedding...

661
01:03:31,150 --> 01:03:37,560
...Other than our son Aktemur and
our daughter Alcicek's wedding.

662
01:03:37,650 --> 01:03:41,810
Didn't you say
we have two weddings tomorrow?

663
01:03:48,550 --> 01:03:49,490
Dears.

664
01:03:51,070 --> 01:03:54,870
Marriage is important for a believer.

665
01:03:55,770 --> 01:03:59,330
War is also equally important

666
01:03:59,690 --> 01:04:03,730
It is for this reason
that both are considered a wedding.

667
01:04:05,190 --> 01:04:07,550
Both lead to our abundance.

668
01:04:10,310 --> 01:04:11,230
With war...

669
01:04:11,870 --> 01:04:15,990
We rule out the infidels.

670
01:04:15,990 --> 01:04:17,890
We tell them about Islam.

671
01:04:18,450 --> 01:04:23,650
Even during war,
we maintain our morals.

672
01:04:25,270 --> 01:04:26,250
For this reason...

673
01:04:26,810 --> 01:04:34,430
...A believer can convert the hearts
of many unbelievers in the battlefield

674
01:04:35,130 --> 01:04:40,230
And he/she becomes a way for them
to be honored with Islam.

675
01:04:43,970 --> 01:04:46,530
Believers multiply.

676
01:04:49,050 --> 01:04:53,110
Perhaps the one who you fought against...

677
01:04:54,030 --> 01:05:00,110
Sees the human morals that you have,
sees Islam in you.

678
01:05:00,370 --> 01:05:04,090
And he becomes your brother in religion.

679
01:05:09,810 --> 01:05:13,710
This does not apply to all of them, of course.

680
01:05:14,390 --> 01:05:20,570
There are some infidels whose
hearts are darkened with sin.

681
01:05:21,430 --> 01:05:23,850
They don't hear what you say.

682
01:05:24,610 --> 01:05:27,330
They don't see what you show.

683
01:05:28,570 --> 01:05:34,210
They do not give up on fighting
against our religion and Allah.

684
01:05:36,150 --> 01:05:38,750
And for those...

685
01:05:39,270 --> 01:05:44,430
Our swords and hearts will always be strong.

686
01:05:45,910 --> 01:05:48,350
We will not have mercy on the oppressor.

687
01:05:48,850 --> 01:05:52,570
So that we can preserve
the rights of the oppressed.

688
01:05:55,050 --> 01:05:56,970
This is our case, my sheikh.

689
01:05:57,470 --> 01:06:02,390
We will listen to the words of the Messenger
of Allah and we will follow his path.

690
01:06:02,810 --> 01:06:04,990
- Inshallah my Bey.
- Inshallah.

691
01:06:05,850 --> 01:06:07,610
That's why we want the number.

692
01:06:07,850 --> 01:06:12,330
We must be many to stand up
to the oppressors.

693
01:06:12,470 --> 01:06:15,390
This is what will move us forward.

694
01:06:15,710 --> 01:06:19,910
This is the origin of the river that
will feed our ambitions

695
01:06:20,830 --> 01:06:25,510
We are destined to be the swords
that clash for the glory of Islam.

696
01:06:25,930 --> 01:06:26,710
However...

697
01:06:27,170 --> 01:06:30,850
For those swords
we need a lot of hands, my sheikh

698
01:06:31,630 --> 01:06:32,850
Allah bless you.

699
01:06:33,790 --> 01:06:35,930
Our alps are valiant.

700
01:06:36,430 --> 01:06:40,770
When they hear about the other wedding,
which is war, they do not hesitate.

701
01:06:44,010 --> 01:06:45,730
But I see that...

702
01:06:46,830 --> 01:06:51,150
When it comes to the actual wedding,
they are too lazy.

703
01:06:55,190 --> 01:06:57,530
Their turns will come, my sheikh.

704
01:06:59,050 --> 01:07:00,950
All of them will have their turns.

705
01:07:00,950 --> 01:07:02,950
Let us take Inegol first.

706
01:07:02,950 --> 01:07:06,290
Then we will hold a wedding for
all of them there, Inshallah.

707
01:07:06,290 --> 01:07:08,290
There is no escape for them.

708
01:07:09,270 --> 01:07:10,290
As you say, my Bey.

709
01:07:10,550 --> 01:07:11,730
As you say, my Bey.

710
01:07:11,730 --> 01:07:14,930
Of course, of course.

711
01:07:19,890 --> 01:07:23,410
"Look at the bride."

712
01:07:23,410 --> 01:07:27,030
She put henna on her hand.

713
01:07:27,030 --> 01:07:30,630
"Don't say anything to her."

714
01:07:30,630 --> 01:07:34,350
She will grieve and go home.

715
01:07:34,350 --> 01:07:37,610
"Her door is curved"

716
01:07:37,610 --> 01:07:41,430
"She looks like an angel."

717
01:07:41,430 --> 01:07:45,350
"Congratulations to you bride"

718
01:07:45,350 --> 01:07:49,070
May your family be happy.

719
01:07:49,070 --> 01:07:53,090
"Look at the bride."

720
01:07:53,210 --> 01:07:56,470
She put henna on her hand.

721
01:07:56,630 --> 01:08:00,070
"Don't say anything to her."

722
01:08:00,070 --> 01:08:03,750
She will grieve and go home.

723
01:08:03,750 --> 01:08:07,310
"Her door is curved"

724
01:08:07,310 --> 01:08:10,910
"She looks like an angel."

725
01:08:11,130 --> 01:08:14,830
"Congratulations to you henna"

726
01:08:14,830 --> 01:08:18,890
May your family be happy.

727
01:08:19,290 --> 01:08:21,450
May your henna be blessed, my daughter

728
01:08:21,870 --> 01:08:23,450
May you be blessed

729
01:08:34,970 --> 01:08:36,270
My flower.

730
01:08:43,170 --> 01:08:45,609
It's the hard aspect of motherhood,
Bengi Hatun.

731
01:08:48,950 --> 01:08:51,529
Tell me about it, Malhun Hatun.

732
01:08:52,490 --> 01:08:54,330
I feel like my liver is being ripped out.

733
01:08:59,189 --> 01:09:02,510
Bengi Hatun,
don't worry

734
01:09:03,370 --> 01:09:07,050
Know that I will treat your
daughter as if she is my own.

735
01:09:07,050 --> 01:09:08,229
I know...

736
01:09:08,229 --> 01:09:10,229
I know, Ayse Hatun.

737
01:09:10,229 --> 01:09:12,229
I'm not worried but...

738
01:09:12,950 --> 01:09:14,229
It's motherhood.

739
01:09:21,529 --> 01:09:22,990
Yes, Hatuns.

740
01:09:23,630 --> 01:09:26,029
Let's make henna for the war, shall we?

741
01:09:26,850 --> 01:09:27,970
Of course.

742
01:09:27,970 --> 01:09:29,970
How can a war be without henna?

743
01:09:30,149 --> 01:09:31,130
Come on then.

744
01:09:31,950 --> 01:09:33,149
Come here.

745
01:09:37,290 --> 01:09:39,970
In the name of Allah, the most gracious, the most merciful

746
01:09:40,910 --> 01:09:44,189
Swords to the fighters, henna to the sacrifice.

747
01:09:44,189 --> 01:09:48,090
The sisters compete with the men
to obtain shahada.

748
01:09:48,090 --> 01:09:51,090
Martyrdom is life for us
and conquest mean blood in the vein!

749
01:09:51,090 --> 01:09:53,090
If you are thirsty...

750
01:09:53,090 --> 01:09:55,090
So fill your heart with martyrdom!

751
01:09:55,090 --> 01:09:56,570
Sisters, sisters!

752
01:09:56,750 --> 01:09:58,430
Hold on to Mother Fatma's hand

753
01:09:58,430 --> 01:10:02,210
The sisters compete with the men
to obtain shahada

754
01:10:04,790 --> 01:10:09,070
In the name of Allah, the most gracious,
the most merciful

755
01:10:31,350 --> 01:10:33,710
Allah is the greatest!

756
01:10:37,430 --> 01:10:39,630
Allah listens to those who praise him!

757
01:10:40,170 --> 01:10:42,130
Allah is the greatest.

758
01:10:48,790 --> 01:10:51,290
Allah is the greatest.

759
01:10:53,890 --> 01:10:56,650
Allah is the greatest.

760
01:11:01,130 --> 01:11:03,590
Allah is the greatest.

761
01:11:27,270 --> 01:11:33,170
Allah's peace shall be upon you.
Allah's peace shall be upon you.

762
01:11:48,870 --> 01:11:51,150
Praise be to Allah...

763
01:11:52,310 --> 01:11:55,450
... who honored
us to carry his message

764
01:11:55,450 --> 01:11:57,450
Amen

765
01:11:57,450 --> 01:11:59,450
And who honored us with conquests

766
01:12:00,190 --> 01:12:03,930
We praise You, who has honored us
by opening many closed doors

767
01:12:03,930 --> 01:12:05,930
Amen

768
01:12:07,070 --> 01:12:13,970
We thank Allah who tested us by
making us lose what we gained!

769
01:12:14,120 --> 01:12:15,620
Amen.

770
01:12:17,390 --> 01:12:20,990
Dying is forbidden for us
before recovering what we lost!

771
01:12:21,490 --> 01:12:24,510
-And this is our oath!
-Our oath!

772
01:12:24,510 --> 01:12:27,010
Answer our prayers, Lord

773
01:12:27,010 --> 01:12:29,530
-Amen,
-Amen, Lord

774
01:12:34,730 --> 01:12:38,990
Alps, the conquest of Inegol is near.

775
01:12:39,530 --> 01:12:40,990
And what we need to do is...

776
01:12:41,970 --> 01:12:44,950
...to deliver Yenişehir to Osman Bey.

777
01:12:45,690 --> 01:12:48,190
Let everyone know what his mission is.

778
01:12:49,010 --> 01:12:50,750
Entrances and exits of the city...

779
01:12:51,010 --> 01:12:52,590
...warehouses...

780
01:12:52,990 --> 01:12:54,590
...and watch towers...

781
01:12:54,590 --> 01:12:57,630
We increased the number of alps
at the places you said, my Bey.

782
01:12:57,930 --> 01:12:59,790
Everyone go to their duty.

783
01:12:59,870 --> 01:13:01,270
Yes my Bey!

784
01:13:09,210 --> 01:13:10,050
Brother.

785
01:13:11,250 --> 01:13:12,510
Tell me, brother.

786
01:13:14,690 --> 01:13:16,990
We will win in Inegol, won't we?

787
01:13:27,970 --> 01:13:29,910
This is the weakest gate, Cerkutay.

788
01:13:31,630 --> 01:13:34,610
Osman Bey and his alps will deploy here.

789
01:13:35,070 --> 01:13:36,610
Kutan, Acar...

790
01:13:37,870 --> 01:13:38,610
Ulgen.

791
01:13:39,110 --> 01:13:41,430
You will lead the soldiers into the corridor.

792
01:13:41,430 --> 01:13:43,730
The Sisters of Kayi will get there
just in time.

793
01:13:43,730 --> 01:13:45,730
While you crush the soldiers..

794
01:13:46,110 --> 01:13:48,410
Cerkutay will open the gate for our people.

795
01:13:48,410 --> 01:13:50,410
Those dogs will fall.

796
01:13:50,410 --> 01:13:52,410
Never worry, Turgut Bey.

797
01:13:52,410 --> 01:13:56,870
Sister Irene is so popular in the castle
that I can go anywhere without arousing suspicion.

798
01:13:56,870 --> 01:13:59,990
I see that
even the dog Olof trusts you.

799
01:13:59,990 --> 01:14:03,590
You and Cerkutay have been
on the side of the infidels all this time.

800
01:14:04,670 --> 01:14:08,570
And if the Kayi flag will fly
over this castle...

801
01:14:08,570 --> 01:14:10,570
You have a very great share in this.

802
01:14:10,650 --> 01:14:13,450
Allah bless you.
Without you, we couldn't do that.

803
01:14:14,010 --> 01:14:15,450
It wasn't very difficult.

804
01:14:15,750 --> 01:14:19,090
But if it weren't for me,
they would have caught Cerkutay long ago

805
01:14:22,630 --> 01:14:24,850
Don't speak for me, Ulgen Hatun!

806
01:14:24,850 --> 01:14:26,430
Don't speak for me!

807
01:14:26,430 --> 01:14:28,430
Turgut Bey knows me.

808
01:14:28,910 --> 01:14:29,970
I know of course.

809
01:14:30,250 --> 01:14:33,630
Cerkutay can disguise himself in a thousand ways
so that they won't find out.

810
01:14:37,310 --> 01:14:39,270
But I know something else, Ulgen Hatun.

811
01:14:41,630 --> 01:14:43,010
When do you want it?

812
01:14:48,650 --> 01:14:49,590
Want what?

813
01:14:50,230 --> 01:14:54,160
I'm thinking something,
but what do you mean?

814
01:14:56,170 --> 01:14:59,720
When are you going to join The Sisters?
In my opinion, you deserve it.

815
01:15:02,520 --> 01:15:04,570
I hope to join, Turgut Bey.

816
01:15:06,380 --> 01:15:08,790
Let's conquer the castle first.

817
01:15:09,620 --> 01:15:11,030
Right.

818
01:15:18,560 --> 01:15:24,250
Come on valiants, we won't let the infidels
own this castle, for which we sacrificed.

819
01:15:24,620 --> 01:15:26,620
As you order, my Bey!

820
01:15:40,460 --> 01:15:43,420
I Ask forgiveness of Almighty Allah
and repent to Him!

821
01:15:56,540 --> 01:15:57,870
- My Bey.
- Yes?

822
01:15:58,220 --> 01:16:03,110
Inegol isn't even our war.
Why are you caring so much?

823
01:16:05,230 --> 01:16:07,610
Oh, bird brain Huseyin.

824
01:16:09,260 --> 01:16:13,800
That is why I am caring so much.

825
01:16:16,390 --> 01:16:18,180
What is this?

826
01:16:20,270 --> 01:16:21,260
This is a map.

827
01:16:21,440 --> 01:16:23,960
I Ask forgiveness of Almighty Allah
and repent to Him!

828
01:16:25,930 --> 01:16:28,650
This is the door through which goods enter.

829
01:16:29,670 --> 01:16:31,930
Things enter and exit through here.

830
01:16:32,880 --> 01:16:35,060
Keep this well in your mind.

831
01:16:38,390 --> 01:16:43,260
I'm not planning a military campaign,
I'm planning an escape.

832
01:16:46,800 --> 01:16:52,240
There is no one with whom we did not cooperate,
Osman, Ismahan and even Olof.

833
01:16:54,200 --> 01:16:57,950
And when we see that things are not
going as we want them to.

834
01:16:58,610 --> 01:17:00,850
We have to save ourselves.

835
01:17:02,940 --> 01:17:05,070
I will sacrifice my life for you, my Bey.

836
01:17:06,700 --> 01:17:13,230
Well, we will see on the battlefield
if that's true or not.

837
01:17:18,970 --> 01:17:25,530
There are the gates.
Keep that in your mind.

838
01:17:28,490 --> 01:17:33,220
The time has now come!
The swords will come out of their sheaths for Inegol!

839
01:17:33,590 --> 01:17:36,670
Do not drop your sword
until you cut the head of infidels!

840
01:17:39,350 --> 01:17:42,610
Are you ready to go the battlefield
with us, shoulder to shoulder, Bengi Hatun?

841
01:17:42,610 --> 01:17:45,600
My heart has been burning ever since
I lost my brother, Bala.

842
01:17:46,100 --> 01:17:50,080
Today is the day of revenge
Olof's time is past due.

843
01:17:50,390 --> 01:17:54,970
Today is the day of revenge and the day
of the wedding at the same time, Bengi Hatun.

844
01:17:57,100 --> 01:18:01,170
When we conquer Inegol Castle, we will
hold the wedding of Aktemur and the Alcicek there

845
01:18:01,560 --> 01:18:02,850
Inshallah.

846
01:18:04,010 --> 01:18:05,320
Inshallah.

847
01:18:08,750 --> 01:18:12,400
Where is Oktem Bey, Bengi Hatun?

848
01:18:13,250 --> 01:18:18,310
He went to Marmaracik, Bala Hatun.
He'll take alps and go to Inegol.

849
01:18:21,550 --> 01:18:26,080
Let's depart, Hatuns.
Let's cut the breath of the oppressors!

850
01:18:27,480 --> 01:18:32,100
Hey sisters with red henna!
Today is the day of conquest. Let's go!

851
01:18:37,470 --> 01:18:39,930
Marmaracik Castle.

852
01:18:45,650 --> 01:18:47,840
Praise be upon you!

853
01:18:52,030 --> 01:18:55,060
My alps, my valiants!

854
01:18:56,480 --> 01:19:01,230
We're going to take what's ours!
We are going to take Inegol!

855
01:19:03,650 --> 01:19:05,270
Bring my horse.

856
01:19:07,370 --> 01:19:10,850
Mongols are coming!
Mongols are coming!

857
01:19:29,780 --> 01:19:34,350
The war came to us
while we were going to it!

858
01:19:34,970 --> 01:19:36,640
Welcome!

859
01:19:38,910 --> 01:19:41,130
Today is the day of shahada!

860
01:19:42,590 --> 01:19:45,610
- Allah is eternal!
- Allah is eternal!

861
01:19:45,640 --> 01:19:48,320
Hold the gates and be careful!

862
01:20:22,040 --> 01:20:23,870
Break the gates!

863
01:21:11,920 --> 01:21:13,900
Infidels!

864
01:21:25,780 --> 01:21:28,160
My Bey, the gates won't bear anymore!

865
01:21:28,550 --> 01:21:30,290
They are about to get in!

866
01:21:31,420 --> 01:21:35,880
They are trying to break through our gates!
They want to own what is ours!

867
01:21:40,800 --> 01:21:44,540
Obviously, we will be martyred today!

868
01:21:44,910 --> 01:21:49,340
But we will not die without
taking them down with us!

869
01:21:49,530 --> 01:21:53,080
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

870
01:21:54,910 --> 01:21:58,580
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

871
01:23:46,060 --> 01:23:49,060
What is the reason
of your visit, Mother Sultan?

872
01:23:49,960 --> 01:23:58,800
I came to remind you that you have Inegol
only thanks to me, Olof.

873
01:24:00,790 --> 01:24:03,900
I don't think so, Mother Sultan.

874
01:24:04,990 --> 01:24:09,710
Yes, you helped a bit.

875
01:24:10,660 --> 01:24:12,630
But nothing else.

876
01:24:14,100 --> 01:24:18,410
I took Inegol with my sword!

877
01:24:22,200 --> 01:24:24,370
Your sword is mine
and your castle as well!

878
01:24:25,240 --> 01:24:29,180
I confronted you when
you conquered Inegol back then.

879
01:24:29,760 --> 01:24:36,900
You told me that you were at my service,
that what's yours was also mine.

880
01:24:38,130 --> 01:24:40,020
What's up now, Olof?

881
01:24:43,750 --> 01:24:46,900
Things changed, Mother Sultan.

882
01:24:49,460 --> 01:24:52,690
I rose while you fell.

883
01:24:56,250 --> 01:24:58,710
You can no longer rule me.

884
01:25:00,870 --> 01:25:07,750
Seems that Nayman standing behind you
encouraged you a lot

885
01:25:11,850 --> 01:25:14,270
Or is it that he stands against me?

886
01:25:15,470 --> 01:25:19,370
Olof... Olof...

887
01:25:20,350 --> 01:25:25,070
Do you think Nayman
has just allied with you?

888
01:25:27,330 --> 01:25:28,910
What does this mean?

889
01:25:33,540 --> 01:25:41,830
It means that you are just the owner of this
tiny castle and a commander of a weak Emperor.

890
01:25:45,840 --> 01:25:47,900
We are the Seljuqs.

891
01:25:49,400 --> 01:25:54,100
You can only be
a puppet of Nayman, Olof.

892
01:25:55,110 --> 01:25:59,340
And when he's done with you,
you'll be the first to die.

893
01:26:02,750 --> 01:26:09,450
Without my protection,
you are an easy prey for Nayman, Olof.

894
01:26:10,020 --> 01:26:16,350
The army sent by Emperor Andronicus
will come to my command in a few days.

895
01:26:18,790 --> 01:26:23,440
Your protection?
Only Lord protects me!

896
01:26:24,980 --> 01:26:29,700
Also, if you trusted me,
if you were my friend...

897
01:26:31,940 --> 01:26:34,360
You wouldn't come here armed.

898
01:26:41,770 --> 01:26:46,860
Inegol was watered with the blood
of my brother Gunduz Bey.

899
01:26:47,630 --> 01:26:51,760
It was protected by the sword of Turgut Bey.

900
01:26:51,960 --> 01:26:58,400
But we lost it due to
the traitors among us!

901
01:27:00,660 --> 01:27:04,450
If we pursued the revenge...

902
01:27:05,530 --> 01:27:11,590
Or if we pursued wealth, we would have
conquered it 20 times by now!

903
01:27:16,410 --> 01:27:20,570
But everything has a right time.
But everything has a right time!

904
01:27:22,310 --> 01:27:27,990
And for Inegol,
the time has come.

905
01:27:31,470 --> 01:27:35,390
When Turgut Bey opens the gates...

906
01:27:37,430 --> 01:27:39,700
You will strike the archers first.

907
01:27:44,730 --> 01:27:49,700
We are going to protect our alps
inside and outside.

908
01:27:52,410 --> 01:27:57,700
And when the soldiers approach the door,
Hatuns will begin to cross the tunnel.

909
01:27:58,350 --> 01:28:03,470
We will shoot arrows to the soldiers.
They won't understand where we are.

910
01:28:04,190 --> 01:28:06,500
Always remember!

911
01:28:07,010 --> 01:28:15,920
We show mercy to those who ask for forgiveness.
But when they raise their swords, be a lion!

912
01:29:12,460 --> 01:29:13,900
My Alps.

913
01:29:18,610 --> 01:29:22,320
I won't kill you now.

914
01:29:40,630 --> 01:29:44,210
You think you're very smart, Olof.

915
01:29:46,140 --> 01:29:48,440
You're right, I am armed.

916
01:29:49,230 --> 01:29:53,580
Because there is Osman
who attacks everywhere like a madman.

917
01:29:56,930 --> 01:30:00,010
We don't know whom he will attack.

918
01:30:02,550 --> 01:30:05,340
Is there something
you want to say, Mother Sultan?

919
01:30:05,500 --> 01:30:10,050
I just wanted to explain
why I am armed.

920
01:30:10,450 --> 01:30:14,590
I am safe in my castle in Inegol.

921
01:30:15,050 --> 01:30:19,410
But I might get caught in a trap
when I get out of here.

922
01:30:19,570 --> 01:30:24,550
Do you still think you own my castle?

923
01:30:26,500 --> 01:30:30,610
If it isn't for me protecting your castle...

924
01:30:30,870 --> 01:30:37,180
you will be kiled either by
Naiman or by Osman one day, Olof.

925
01:30:38,020 --> 01:30:40,640
Nobody can kill me.

926
01:30:40,940 --> 01:30:43,180
I am invincible.

927
01:30:47,130 --> 01:30:49,600
Inegol is my castle

928
01:30:49,790 --> 01:30:55,010
The Byzantine army will come from one side,
and my brothers from the north!

929
01:30:55,280 --> 01:30:58,170
I lost a lot in these lands!

930
01:30:58,690 --> 01:31:03,120
I will not share my winnings with anyone!

931
01:31:03,310 --> 01:31:09,560
- If you don't share, you won't have anything left.
- Enough, enough!

932
01:31:12,750 --> 01:31:19,460
I forgive you today for
helping me in the past!

933
01:31:22,370 --> 01:31:23,580
Now...

934
01:31:25,150 --> 01:31:26,380
Get out of my castle...

935
01:31:26,720 --> 01:31:28,280
Right now!

936
01:31:33,040 --> 01:31:40,640
Well, I told you my opinion, I warned you.

937
01:31:43,540 --> 01:31:46,050
You did not greet me when I came.

938
01:31:46,780 --> 01:31:52,840
Accompany us at least
to the yard as we leave, Olof

939
01:31:59,690 --> 01:32:04,550
Kayi Hatuns will enter the den
of infidels today!

940
01:32:04,820 --> 01:32:09,620
And when the gates open,
we too will go inside

941
01:32:09,780 --> 01:32:15,590
Don't forget,
no one will run towards death today!

942
01:32:16,030 --> 01:32:21,090
No one will endanger the victory today!

943
01:32:22,030 --> 01:32:24,580
We have the numbers today!

944
01:32:24,820 --> 01:32:29,690
We are the strong ones today!

945
01:32:30,450 --> 01:32:35,230
Absolute victory will be ours!

946
01:32:35,420 --> 01:32:41,400
Do we still have the numbers while
Ismahan and Bayindir are inside?

947
01:32:41,650 --> 01:32:47,060
No, we left them no other choice
but to join us.

948
01:32:48,270 --> 01:32:52,660
They want Olof's head more than we do!

949
01:32:54,500 --> 01:33:01,660
They know that if Olof's head doesn't fall,
they will fall!

950
01:33:02,260 --> 01:33:08,750
Do not forget! We may be at the same side
with them in this war...

951
01:33:09,580 --> 01:33:11,840
But we have still an account to settle.

952
01:33:12,780 --> 01:33:17,600
But we will hold Olof accountable first,
and then we will hold them accountable

953
01:33:17,840 --> 01:33:23,960
As you command, my Bey!
As you command, my Bey!

954
01:33:25,610 --> 01:33:27,200
Alps!

955
01:33:28,740 --> 01:33:33,590
- May our conquest be blessed!
- Amen

956
01:33:33,780 --> 01:33:35,210
Allah is the greatest!

957
01:33:35,320 --> 01:33:49,680
Allah is the greatest! Allah is the greatest!

958
01:34:03,640 --> 01:34:07,750
We got close to the corridor,
we have to be careful now!

959
01:34:07,890 --> 01:34:11,350
Time is short, we have to cross the corridor
before the soldiers arrive!

960
01:34:11,460 --> 01:34:14,620
Don't rush, Bengi Hatun!
Ulgen will open the way for us.

961
01:34:14,760 --> 01:34:17,760
Come on, sisters, hurry up, come on!

962
01:34:19,060 --> 01:34:21,280
Hurry! Now! Hurry!

963
01:34:21,410 --> 01:34:23,800
- Hurry!
- Hurry!

964
01:34:30,530 --> 01:34:32,610
Where are you sisters?

965
01:34:38,780 --> 01:34:40,270
Ulgen!

966
01:34:44,540 --> 01:34:45,920
Ulgen!

967
01:34:46,060 --> 01:34:50,500
I will open, sisters, I will open!
Be patient!

968
01:35:02,480 --> 01:35:04,290
Traitors!

969
01:35:25,800 --> 01:35:27,210
Welcome!

970
01:35:27,390 --> 01:35:29,370
- Thank Allah.
- Greetings, Ulgen!

971
01:35:29,500 --> 01:35:32,020
Welcome,
you brought joy!

972
01:35:32,400 --> 01:35:34,270
Welcome.

973
01:35:34,540 --> 01:35:36,860
You barely did it!

974
01:35:37,620 --> 01:35:39,160
Welcome!

975
01:35:39,510 --> 01:35:42,170
- Thank you.
- Welcome.

976
01:35:52,610 --> 01:35:55,720
Come on Hatuns
the arena is ours now!

977
01:35:55,910 --> 01:35:59,180
Sisters, do not let them!

978
01:35:59,590 --> 01:36:02,350
Come on sisters!
This way!

979
01:36:56,420 --> 01:36:58,340
The Turks are coming!

980
01:36:58,890 --> 01:37:01,460
To the walls!

981
01:37:02,210 --> 01:37:04,970
Close the doors!

982
01:37:05,110 --> 01:37:08,570
- Come quickly!
- Archers!

983
01:37:24,560 --> 01:37:28,560
It's time for us to fulfill our duty!

984
01:37:33,190 --> 01:37:35,350
What's happening here?

985
01:37:45,740 --> 01:37:50,610
- I told you that I'd come, Olof.
- You ignobles!

986
01:37:55,230 --> 01:37:58,830
I told you you would lose
if you didn't share, Olof!

987
01:39:51,830 --> 01:39:55,400
Gates! Gates!

988
01:39:56,940 --> 01:39:59,620
I am here, Cerkutay!

989
01:40:04,330 --> 01:40:06,170
Alps!

990
01:40:13,850 --> 01:40:15,820
What are you doing here?

991
01:40:16,420 --> 01:40:18,690
I came to save you.

992
01:40:18,880 --> 01:40:20,960
I came to kill them!

993
01:40:21,990 --> 01:40:23,130
Gates!

994
01:40:24,720 --> 01:40:26,020
Cerkutay!

995
01:40:27,920 --> 01:40:29,150
Gates!

996
01:40:43,400 --> 01:40:44,710
Gates!

997
01:40:45,260 --> 01:40:47,410
For the country!

998
01:40:48,440 --> 01:40:49,440
Gates!

999
01:41:06,050 --> 01:41:08,800
We'll break the gates!
Come on alps!

1000
01:41:37,620 --> 01:41:39,380
Praise be!

1001
01:41:40,790 --> 01:41:42,590
Let's go!

1002
01:42:00,910 --> 01:42:03,470
Cerkutay!

1003
01:42:03,970 --> 01:42:05,540
O Allah!

1004
01:42:12,590 --> 01:42:13,770
Osman!

1005
01:42:20,170 --> 01:42:21,620
Cerkutay!

1006
01:42:27,310 --> 01:42:29,350
What did you do to Cerkutay?

1007
01:42:30,140 --> 01:42:32,710
Cerkutay, Cerkutay.

1008
01:42:33,990 --> 01:42:35,130
Let's go.

1009
01:42:39,790 --> 01:42:40,830
Cerkutay.

1010
01:42:41,310 --> 01:42:44,280
Don't ever think about pronouncing
the shahada.

1011
01:42:44,400 --> 01:42:46,880
You will teach me how to use sword!

1012
01:42:48,560 --> 01:42:53,010
What else can I teach you?
You killed them all already.

1013
01:43:28,240 --> 01:43:32,280
Cerkutay, come on, open your eyes!

1014
01:43:32,470 --> 01:43:34,180
Cerkutay is strong!

1015
01:43:34,270 --> 01:43:36,140
Cerkutay is strong!
Cerkutay won't die!

1016
01:43:36,280 --> 01:43:39,740
Cerkutay, don't go!
I'll cook for you!

1017
01:43:41,850 --> 01:43:44,000
Cerkutay!

1018
01:44:21,260 --> 01:44:23,640
This is my castle, Osman!

1019
01:44:24,110 --> 01:44:26,350
I am not like the people before me!

1020
01:44:26,480 --> 01:44:28,900
What you are waiting for is your end only!

1021
01:44:29,200 --> 01:44:33,230
Your cruelty has brought your death!

1022
01:45:15,370 --> 01:45:17,290
Nothing will stand in our way!

1023
01:45:17,290 --> 01:45:18,660
We will sacrifice our lives if necessary!

1024
01:45:18,660 --> 01:45:20,920
We're not going anywhere
until we take Inegol!

1025
01:45:35,410 --> 01:45:37,140
Praise be!

1026
01:45:37,140 --> 01:45:39,490
I gave birth to a girl
braver than men!

1027
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:42,570
She is like her mother!

1028
01:45:42,660 --> 01:45:45,400
I mean mother in law!

1029
01:45:55,400 --> 01:45:58,530
- Come on, Hatuns!
- Come on!

1030
01:46:00,530 --> 01:46:02,070
Come on, this direction!

1031
01:46:05,810 --> 01:46:07,430
Come to me, ignobles!

1032
01:46:27,220 --> 01:46:28,090
Alcicek!

1033
01:46:35,110 --> 01:46:37,220
I owe you my soul, Subasi.

1034
01:46:37,730 --> 01:46:40,680
You owe nothing.
Our lives are one.

1035
01:46:41,190 --> 01:46:42,040
Let's go.

1036
01:47:07,400 --> 01:47:09,960
Do you miss your country, Acar brother?

1037
01:47:12,020 --> 01:47:16,180
I don't know if he missed or not,
but he certainly missed the battle!

1038
01:47:16,370 --> 01:47:17,750
Thank you, brother!

1039
01:47:20,730 --> 01:47:24,280
I can't keep protecting you, brother!
Protect your back!

1040
01:47:24,280 --> 01:47:25,190
Okay!

1041
01:47:27,620 --> 01:47:29,270
I couldn't protect you!

1042
01:47:32,230 --> 01:47:33,590
Cerkutay!

1043
01:47:49,750 --> 01:47:50,850
Cerkutay!

1044
01:47:51,670 --> 01:47:52,650
Cerkutay!

1045
01:47:52,840 --> 01:47:55,400
He lost a lot of blood, Boran.

1046
01:47:55,670 --> 01:47:57,540
Oh brother, Cerkutay!

1047
01:47:57,850 --> 01:48:00,290
Nothing will happen to Cerkutay!

1048
01:48:00,520 --> 01:48:02,290
Kumral Abdal!

1049
01:48:04,290 --> 01:48:06,490
Cerkutay!

1050
01:48:06,490 --> 01:48:07,140
Kumaral Abdal!

1051
01:48:07,640 --> 01:48:10,070
- Cerkutay!
- He's hurt a lot!

1052
01:48:12,070 --> 01:48:14,210
Hold on, brother.

1053
01:48:14,210 --> 01:48:17,060
Alps! Alps!

1054
01:48:17,060 --> 01:48:19,060
- Come on!
- Come on, come on!

1055
01:48:19,060 --> 01:48:20,850
Let's go!

1056
01:48:21,220 --> 01:48:22,660
Come on, Cerkutay!

1057
01:48:22,660 --> 01:48:24,250
Come on brothers!

1058
01:48:24,250 --> 01:48:26,450
Cerkutay! Cerkutay!

1059
01:48:27,510 --> 01:48:29,010
Cerkutay!

1060
01:48:38,600 --> 01:48:40,820
This will end right here, right now Olof!

1061
01:48:41,210 --> 01:48:42,450
No capturing!

1062
01:48:42,890 --> 01:48:44,210
No prison!

1063
01:48:44,660 --> 01:48:46,250
There is only death!

1064
01:48:47,330 --> 01:48:49,380
That's why I'm not going alone!

1065
01:48:50,360 --> 01:48:52,090
You will not be alone!

1066
01:48:52,690 --> 01:48:55,450
Frigg will be waiting for you there!

1067
01:48:56,330 --> 01:48:59,350
I'll send you there now!

1068
01:48:59,700 --> 01:49:01,030
No!

1069
01:49:42,420 --> 01:49:44,710
You oppressed many innocents!

1070
01:49:49,220 --> 01:49:51,290
You oppressed many orphans!

1071
01:49:54,130 --> 01:49:57,720
Your death will brind justice!

1072
01:50:00,710 --> 01:50:02,280
Come here.

1073
01:50:02,280 --> 01:50:04,740
Come on, come on!

1074
01:50:05,370 --> 01:50:09,850
You and those with you,
all of you, this will be the end of you!

1075
01:50:10,170 --> 01:50:12,050
What is ours, will remain ours!

1076
01:50:12,550 --> 01:50:14,150
What's left for you...

1077
01:50:15,720 --> 01:50:17,300
...is only death!

1078
01:51:31,170 --> 01:51:32,180
Thank Allah.

1079
01:51:33,970 --> 01:51:37,350
Thank Lord.

1080
01:51:49,720 --> 01:52:05,690
Allah is the greatest!
Allah is the greatest!

1081
01:52:11,670 --> 01:52:13,140
You jackals!

1082
01:52:15,480 --> 01:52:17,050
Come here, ignoble dogs!

1083
01:52:17,330 --> 01:52:19,290
We'll send you to hell!

1084
01:52:28,040 --> 01:52:29,270
Bala Hatun!

1085
01:52:42,090 --> 01:52:46,250
So we were destined to fight
back to back, Ismahan Sultan!

1086
01:52:47,970 --> 01:52:50,760
What's past is past, Bala Hatun!

1087
01:53:07,890 --> 01:53:11,780
Now we unite, but what if you stab us
from behind tomorrow?

1088
01:53:23,210 --> 01:53:28,180
If one day I point my dagger at you,
you will see it, Malhun Hatun.

1089
01:53:36,770 --> 01:53:38,900
The same goes for you too, Ismahan Sultan.

1090
01:53:41,110 --> 01:53:42,370
The same goes for you.

1091
01:55:18,330 --> 01:55:22,870
We don't fight for the fame.

1092
01:55:23,270 --> 01:55:26,790
We do not rise our swords
for wealth.

1093
01:55:27,960 --> 01:55:33,490
The property we take is
for the cause of world order!

1094
01:55:33,910 --> 01:55:37,210
We take property to destroy the infidels!

1095
01:55:38,950 --> 01:55:40,130
Do not forget.

1096
01:55:41,350 --> 01:55:44,840
Wealth is only for the mortal life.

1097
01:55:45,810 --> 01:55:49,320
It will remain an inheritance
for our generation.

1098
01:55:51,130 --> 01:55:55,880
But whoever tries to take our inheritance...

1099
01:55:57,030 --> 01:56:01,010
Whoever takes our inheritance...

1100
01:56:02,150 --> 01:56:03,690
Then...

1101
01:56:04,730 --> 01:56:06,390
They won't be resting.

1102
01:56:07,770 --> 01:56:10,490
Nor will be sleeping.

1103
01:56:11,860 --> 01:56:15,930
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

1104
01:56:16,020 --> 01:56:26,650
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

1105
01:56:35,540 --> 01:56:38,470
Mother, what happened?

1106
01:56:39,540 --> 01:56:41,480
I'm not comfortable, Alcicek.

1107
01:56:42,770 --> 01:56:45,080
Your father is late, something is wrong.

1108
01:56:45,820 --> 01:56:49,030
My valiant, he is always the first
one to appear when it is about war.

1109
01:56:49,030 --> 01:56:52,500
Don't worry mother,
he'll come if Alalh permits.

1110
01:56:56,040 --> 01:56:57,430
Bring that dog!

1111
01:58:00,310 --> 01:58:01,930
Not one of you...

1112
01:58:06,610 --> 01:58:08,980
But even if one thousnad of you faced me...

1113
01:58:10,020 --> 01:58:13,770
I will never back down from the case of Allah!

1114
01:58:19,560 --> 01:58:22,260
Even if you all unite against me...

1115
01:58:26,260 --> 01:58:28,180
Your end will be the same.

1116
01:58:39,410 --> 01:58:41,750
I fought all my life.

1117
01:58:43,330 --> 01:58:46,210
I finished thousands like you.

1118
01:58:50,550 --> 01:58:54,810
Byzantium will turn this land into hell.

1119
01:59:00,390 --> 01:59:04,470
You got stuck between Neiman and Andronikos

1120
01:59:05,890 --> 01:59:07,700
Your death is near Osman.

1121
01:59:10,090 --> 01:59:11,650
Your death is near.

1122
01:59:13,990 --> 01:59:19,450
For those who walk for our cause,
death is always near.

1123
01:59:24,230 --> 01:59:25,910
Death is our compass.

1124
01:59:26,900 --> 01:59:29,160
And shahada is a wedding for us.

1125
01:59:36,760 --> 01:59:38,210
But...

1126
01:59:42,070 --> 01:59:43,290
But...

1127
01:59:47,690 --> 01:59:49,810
Your head will fall off today.

1128
02:00:33,950 --> 02:00:35,070
My Bey!

1129
02:00:36,080 --> 02:00:37,180
Nayman is coming!

1130
02:01:25,410 --> 02:01:32,170
You are not brave enough to kill
Nayman's friend in front of him.

1131
02:02:17,520 --> 02:02:20,760
We both hunted well today, Osman.

1132
02:02:25,050 --> 02:02:26,830
- Father!
- Oktem!

1133
02:02:27,410 --> 02:02:28,480
- Father!
- Oktem!

1134
02:02:29,090 --> 02:02:30,680
- Father!
- Oktem!

1135
02:02:34,310 --> 02:02:35,310
Oktem.

1136
02:03:07,430 --> 02:03:08,560
This fool...

1137
02:03:09,880 --> 02:03:12,440
He thinks he can kill me, Nayman!

1138
02:03:17,710 --> 02:03:19,070
He is mistaken.

1139
02:03:20,780 --> 02:03:23,240
Just like the Mother next to him!

1140
02:03:24,320 --> 02:03:27,600
She also chose the wrong side!

1141
02:03:29,020 --> 02:03:30,980
She offered me gold first

1142
02:03:31,720 --> 02:03:34,400
Now she is offering me her head.

1143
02:03:35,530 --> 02:03:37,100
I didn't chose the wrong side!

1144
02:03:37,660 --> 02:03:40,150
I turned back from the wrong side, Nayman!

1145
02:03:52,970 --> 02:03:54,070
Osman.

1146
02:03:55,310 --> 02:03:59,380
If you don't care about Oktem's life.

1147
02:04:09,750 --> 02:04:10,900
Kill Olof.

1148
02:04:12,140 --> 02:04:13,150
Bengi.

1149
02:04:29,860 --> 02:04:31,650
What are we fighting for?

1150
02:04:32,480 --> 02:04:33,490
My Bey?

1151
02:04:48,360 --> 02:04:49,920
For the cause of Allah.

1152
02:04:54,300 --> 02:04:55,960
Why are our men martyred?

1153
02:04:57,830 --> 02:04:59,200
In order to rule the world!

1154
02:05:10,170 --> 02:05:11,890
And for what the living live?

1155
02:05:20,420 --> 02:05:22,490
For The Red Apple
(Symbol of the ideas and desiers of Turks)

1156
02:05:31,650 --> 02:05:32,730
So...

1157
02:05:36,400 --> 02:05:37,680
This old wolf...

1158
02:05:38,760 --> 02:05:40,630
...has to die today.

1159
02:05:50,640 --> 02:05:52,010
No, Osman Bey.

1160
02:05:54,610 --> 02:05:58,880
Do not cosider my life equal
with that dog's life.

1161
02:06:00,550 --> 02:06:02,830
He is just a dog while I yearn for shahada.

1162
02:06:31,380 --> 02:06:33,760
You will let Olof free, Osman.

1163
02:06:37,610 --> 02:06:38,690
Otherwise...

1164
02:06:39,460 --> 02:06:41,900
Oktem will be only a beginning.

1165
02:06:52,560 --> 02:06:55,910
I will not stop until I destroy you as a whole.

1166
02:07:14,140 --> 02:07:15,240
Make an agreement.

1167
02:07:16,780 --> 02:07:19,290
We wanted to take the castle and we did.

1168
02:07:20,590 --> 02:07:21,970
We kill Olof later.

1169
02:07:22,730 --> 02:07:23,820
No.

1170
02:07:30,110 --> 02:07:31,120
Don't do it, Osman.

1171
02:07:31,700 --> 02:07:32,810
No.

1172
02:07:34,930 --> 02:07:36,320
He will die today.

1173
02:07:59,340 --> 02:08:01,760
Don't Osman, don't.

1174
02:08:09,300 --> 02:08:11,990
There is only one idea
we are loyal to.

1175
02:08:14,690 --> 02:08:16,170
Mercy to the cruel...

1176
02:08:19,010 --> 02:08:20,760
...is an insult to the innocents.

1177
02:08:26,420 --> 02:08:28,880
Your sword won't just kill Olof...

1178
02:08:29,640 --> 02:08:31,760
It will also kill Oktem.

1179
02:08:52,900 --> 02:08:53,950
You are right.

1180
02:08:54,860 --> 02:08:56,330
But with one difference.

1181
02:09:00,370 --> 02:09:02,220
If Olof dies, he will be a cadaver

1182
02:09:06,150 --> 02:09:08,180
If Oktem Bey dies,
he will become a martyr

1183
02:09:13,090 --> 02:09:14,220
Tell me!

1184
02:09:15,580 --> 02:09:17,250
Is there anyone who fears death?

1185
02:09:17,300 --> 02:09:19,020
No my Bey!

1186
02:09:19,440 --> 02:09:21,230
Is there anyone who fears death?

1187
02:09:21,310 --> 02:09:22,570
No my Bey!

1188
02:09:36,010 --> 02:09:37,540
Is there anyone who fears death?

1189
02:09:41,380 --> 02:09:42,400
No.

1190
02:09:49,770 --> 02:09:50,830
No.

1191
02:09:55,530 --> 02:09:56,600
No, my Bey.

1192
02:09:57,960 --> 02:09:58,980
No.

1193
02:10:08,180 --> 02:10:09,370
Now look at Olof very well.

1194
02:10:12,240 --> 02:10:13,420
Very well.

1195
02:10:15,550 --> 02:10:16,900
And see how he ends up.

1196
02:11:19,390 --> 02:11:21,340
I bear witness that there is no god but Allah

1197
02:11:22,640 --> 02:11:25,920
And I bear witness that Muhammad is
His servant and Messenger

1198
02:12:12,480 --> 02:12:16,290
We belong to Allah and to Him we shall return

1199
02:12:17,270 --> 02:12:21,160
We belong to Allah and to Him we shall return

1200
02:12:29,870 --> 02:12:31,190
What you just did...

1201
02:12:31,620 --> 02:12:34,320
...will be your end, Osman.

1202
02:12:35,300 --> 02:12:36,460
We will all die.

1203
02:12:38,070 --> 02:12:39,500
But I swear that...

1204
02:12:40,610 --> 02:12:42,630
I will not die before I kill you.

1205
02:12:45,597 --> 02:13:04,797
Visit our website for more: turkision.com